  "title": {
    "zh": "运行 ECS 服务",
    "ja": "ECS サービスを稼働",
    "en": "Run an ECS service"
  },
  "story": {
    "zh": "2035 年，Nova：Shadow Fault 制造了新的故障。任务：运行 ECS 服务。诊断资源并恢复云城。",
    "ja": "2035年、Nova：Shadow Fault が障害を発生。任務：ECS サービスを稼働。リソースを調べ都市を復旧せよ。",
    "en": "2035. Nova: Shadow Fault has caused another incident. Mission: Run an ECS service. Diagnose the resources and restore the city."
  },
  "lesson": {
    "zh": "Task Definition 指定镜像、端口、环境和执行角色；Service 指定实际期望副本数。",
    "ja": "Task はイメージ・ポート・環境・ロールを定義し、Service は必要数を指定。",
    "en": "Tasks declare image, port, environment and execution role; a service declares desired replicas."
  },
  "services": [
    "ECR",
    "ECS",
    "EKS"
  ],
